# Type-aware krit_test (a test, target configuration) and krit_aspect (an
# action, exec configuration) run krit-fir on Bazel's Java runtime; pin a
# hermetic JDK 21 (krit-fir's minimum) for both instead of whichever JDK the
# machine has or Bazel's older exec default.
common --java_runtime_version=remotejdk_21
common --tool_java_runtime_version=remotejdk_21
